{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-panel-shop-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"10","surface":"panel","area":"panel/shop","refs":["F-panel-810","F-panel-809","F-panel-814"],"severity":"S4","title":"Three 'put your gym online first' cards point to the wrong place","what":"Automatic reminders and Workout offer tell the owner to put the gym's records online in Settings, Staff & sign-in. That page cannot do it: it tells the owner to go to Settings, Sign-in & data instead. The check-in poster card names Sign-in & data correctly, but its Open Settings button opens the first Settings tab (Gym), not Sign-in & data.","expected":"All three cards name Settings, Sign-in & data, and the button opens that tab.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/AutoRemindersSection.tsx:104-105","apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/OffersSection.tsx:130-131","apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/CheckInQrScreen.tsx:49-51","apps/dashboard/src/crm/auth/PeopleScreen.tsx:251","apps/dashboard/src/crm/CrmApp.tsx:493-494"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"go-online-place-named-wrong","who":"owners of gyms not yet online","how_often":"every time one of these cards shows","fix_line":"Name Settings, Sign-in & data on both cards and make the poster button open that tab","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-panel-shop-02","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-10","surface":"panel","area":"panel/shop","refs":["F-panel-800","F-panel-807"],"severity":"S4","title":"Shop says new orders show up in a few seconds, and Joined in the app says new members show up at once, but both look only once a minute","what":"The empty orders list says new orders show up on their own in a few seconds. The empty Joined in the app list says members show up there at once. Since the calls were slowed down, the orders are read again once a minute (the bell also once a minute), and the app members list once a minute. A desk waiting for an order can wait up to a minute.","expected":"The words say 'within a minute', or the screens look again as often as the words promise.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/ShopScreen.tsx:174-176","apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/ShopProvider.tsx:40-42","apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/ShopProvider.tsx:237","apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/needsPoll.ts:18","apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/AppMembers.tsx:39","apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/AppMembers.tsx:58-60"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"refresh-time-words-overstated","who":"owners and front desk","how_often":"every time these empty lists show","fix_line":"Change both lines to say within a minute","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-panel-shop-03","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"10","surface":"panel","area":"panel/shop","refs":["F-panel-1119","F-panel-808","F-panel-807","F-panel-814"],"severity":"S4","title":"In Hinglish, the Shop page, Messages & offers, Joined in the app and the check-in poster page stay in English","what":"With Hinglish on, only Invite members, the gym code card and the free trial card in this part read in Hinglish. The Shop page (orders, products, the product form, cancel), Messages & offers, the Joined in the app list and the Check-in QR page never ask for a Hinglish line, so they stay fully English next to Hinglish menus.","expected":"Every owner screen in this part reads in Hinglish when Hinglish is on, or Hinglish says which screens are English only.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/ShopScreen.tsx:80-81","apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/MessagesSection.tsx:342-348","apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/AppMembers.tsx:59","apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/CheckInQrScreen.tsx:36-37","apps/dashboard/src/crm/lang/lang.ts:6-7"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"shop-screens-skip-hinglish-lookup","who":"owners and staff who picked Hinglish","how_often":"every visit to these screens","fix_line":"Pass these screens' words through the Hinglish lookup and add the lines","fix_size":"medium","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-panel-shop-04","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-10","surface":"panel","area":"panel/shop","refs":["F-panel-801","F-panel-808"],"severity":"S4","title":"Two controls go grey with no reason on screen","what":"On a product with 12 choices, '+ Add a choice' turns grey and nothing says 12 is the most. In Messages & offers, after picking 'Pick a day and time', 'Send in the app' stays grey while the day-and-time box is empty, with no word that a day and time are needed.","expected":"A short line next to each control says why it is grey: 'At most 12 choices' and 'Pick a day and a time'.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/ProductSheet.tsx:352-356","apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/logic.ts:365","apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/logic.ts:551","apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/MessagesSection.tsx:557","apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/MessagesSection.tsx:582-583"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"greyed-control-no-reason-shop","who":"owners","how_often":"sometimes","fix_line":"Show the reason line under each grey control","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-panel-shop-05","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-10","surface":"panel","area":"panel/shop","refs":["F-panel-810"],"severity":"S4","title":"The Automatic reminders Save button is greyed when nothing changed, with no word that it is already saved","what":"On Automatic reminders, 'Save changes' is grey until a switch or number changes. The page shows only a count of reminders on and who changed them last, never that what is shown is already saved.","expected":"Next to the grey button: 'Saved. Change a switch to save again.' or similar.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/AutoRemindersSection.tsx:144","apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/AutoRemindersSection.tsx:174-177","apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/AutoRemindersSection.tsx:196-200"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"reminders-save-grey-no-saved-word","who":"owners","how_often":"every visit to Automatic reminders","fix_line":"Add an 'already saved' line beside the grey Save button","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-panel-shop-06","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"10","surface":"panel","area":"panel/shop","refs":["F-panel-809","F-panel-801"],"severity":"S4","title":"A few small lines in the workout offer and product cards read wrong","what":"The workout offer says 'The days are now given by themselves' and offers a choice called 'By themselves', which reads oddly (the days are added automatically). A product with one choice shows '1 flavours' or '1 sizes', because the card always adds an s.","expected":"'Days are now added automatically' / 'Automatically', and '1 flavour' for one choice.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/OffersSection.tsx:199","apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/OffersSection.tsx:293","apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/OffersSection.tsx:411","apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/ShopScreen.tsx:614"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"small-wording-errors-shop","who":"owners and front desk","how_often":"every time these lines show","fix_line":"Reword the offer lines and drop the s for one choice","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
